WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:11.568
Hello! Welcome to Cosmogeek Solutions. Today we will talk about AI Automation and AI Solutions.

2
00:00:11.856 --> 00:00:26.040
Many teams spend hours every week on repetitive work: copying data between systems, reading documents, answering the same questions and preparing reports.

3
00:00:26.328 --> 00:00:34.848
AI and automation can take over this work, so your team can focus on decisions and customers.

4
00:00:35.544 --> 00:00:41.112
First, let us look at the problems AI automation solves.

5
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:49.344
Manual data entry and repetitive admin tasks, which take a lot of time and cause mistakes.

6
00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:56.112
Data scattered across different systems, which delays decisions.

7
00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:03.528
Slow replies to customer queries, because first-level support is not automated.

8
00:01:03.816 --> 00:01:08.688
And inconsistent handoffs of work between teams.

9
00:01:09.384 --> 00:01:12.936
Now let us see what we build.

10
00:01:13.224 --> 00:01:22.752
AI assistants and chatbots trained on your business information that answer common questions.

11
00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:31.464
Document extraction: reading invoices, forms and PDFs and turning them into structured data.

12
00:01:31.752 --> 00:01:39.648
Workflow automation: automatic approvals, notifications and data sync between tools.

13
00:01:39.936 --> 00:01:47.832
LLM integrations that add AI features to your existing software and website.

14
00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:54.120
Predictive analytics: understanding trends and demand from your historical data.

15
00:01:54.408 --> 00:02:01.632
And human-in-the-loop design, so people always stay in control where it matters.

16
00:02:02.328 --> 00:02:09.312
Here is an example. A supplier invoice arrives by email or WhatsApp.

17
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:19.344
AI reads the invoice and automatically extracts fields such as supplier name, amount, GST and date.

18
00:02:19.632 --> 00:02:27.720
The workflow then sends it to a manager for approval. Here, a person checks and approves it.

19
00:02:28.008 --> 00:02:36.528
Once approved, the entry goes into your ERP or accounting system and the dashboard updates.

20
00:02:37.224 --> 00:02:42.528
Our process is practical and starts with a small pilot.

21
00:02:42.816 --> 00:02:51.864
Step one, a process audit. We find which tasks are best suited to automation.

22
00:02:52.152 --> 00:03:01.056
Step two, solution design: choosing the right AI models, data flows and security boundaries.

23
00:03:01.344 --> 00:03:06.864
Step three, building and testing a pilot on one focused use case.

24
00:03:07.152 --> 00:03:14.520
Step four, integration with your CRM, ERP and databases, plus team training.

25
00:03:14.808 --> 00:03:21.000
And step five, monitoring accuracy and results and improving continuously.

26
00:03:21.696 --> 00:03:32.136
We use Python, AI and machine learning models, LLMs, Node.js, PostgreSQL and Docker.

27
00:03:32.424 --> 00:03:39.864
Your data stays within secure boundaries and is not used to train public models.

28
00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.152
So what are the benefits?

29
00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:49.056
Time saved. Repetitive work becomes automatic.

30
00:03:49.344 --> 00:03:55.032
Fewer errors, because processing follows the same rules every time.

31
00:03:55.320 --> 00:04:02.808
Faster responses. AI assistants reply instantly, day or night.

32
00:04:03.096 --> 00:04:08.952
And better decisions, with insights built from your own data.

33
00:04:09.648 --> 00:04:22.656
Where does AI help? Customer support assistants, invoice and document processing, lead qualification, report summaries, and inventory and demand insights.

34
00:04:22.944 --> 00:04:32.448
From agriculture to retail, manufacturing, healthcare and education, every industry has opportunities for automation.

35
00:04:33.144 --> 00:04:43.272
If you want to know where and how AI can help your business, talk to Cosmogeek Solutions.

36
00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:48.792
We will understand your processes and give you practical recommendations.

37
00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:56.544
Click Start a Project, or call or WhatsApp us. Thank you!
